{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國航空航天局當地時間20日公佈了其月球車的最新研發進展及任務規劃。用於探測月球水資源的「揮發物調查極地探索車」（VIPER）計劃於2027年運抵月球南極地區開展探測，載人月球地形車則計劃於2028年前運抵月球南極地區，為未來載人探月和月球基地建設提供支持。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583274.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.042292+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:25:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"5b5da490c89c71c9ff5d1d250fcb7191ddca0004b4eac47eefe8fdbdb04810f5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}